{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47911","headline":"霅溪夜宴诗 八 · 水神","name":"霅溪夜宴诗 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠光龙耀火燑燑，夜接朝云宴渚宫。\n凤管清吹凄极浦，朱弦间奏冷秋空。\n论心幸遇同归友，揣分慙无辅佐功。\n云雨各飞真境後，不堪波上起悲风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"水神","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}